async function api(action,p){const r=await fetch('/.netlify/functions/api?action='+action,{method:p===undefined?'GET':'POST',headers:{...(token?{Authorization:'Bearer '+token}:{}),...(p!==undefined?{'Content-Type':'application/json'}:{})},body:p===undefined?undefined:JSON.stringify(p)});const v=await r.json();if(!r.ok)throw Error(v.error||'Please try again.');return v;}
function options(rows,selected){return rows.map(r=>`<option value="${esc(r.id)}" ${r.id===selected?'selected':''}>${esc(r.name)}</option>`).join('');}
function vendorIdentityKey(v){const email=String(v.email||'').trim().toLowerCase().replace(/,+$/,''),phone=String(v.phone||'').replace(/\D/g,''),name=String(v.business||v.name||'').trim().toLowerCase().replace(/[^a-z0-9]/g,'');return v.vendor_id?'vendor:'+v.vendor_id:email?'email:'+email:phone?'phone:'+phone:name?'name:'+name:'row:'+v.id;}
function dedupeVendorRows(rows){const map=new Map(),rank=v=>v.status==='paid'||v.payment_status==='paid'?5:v.status==='held'?4:v.status==='approved'?3:v.status==='pending'?2:1;for(const v of rows||[]){const k=vendorIdentityKey(v),old=map.get(k);if(!old||rank(v)>rank(old))map.set(k,v);}return [...map.values()];}
function field(name,title,value='',type='text'){return `<label>${title}<input name="${name}" type="${type}" value="${esc(value)}" required></label>`;}
function modal(html){$('#modal-content').innerHTML=html;$('#modal').showModal();}
