 p.innerHTML='<section class="card"><span class="eyebrow">Application recovery</span><h2>Failed & abandoned applications</h2><p>This catches vendor forms that fail validation, stop during photo upload or submission, or are left unfinished for at least 10 minutes. You can see the last step and error log, then recover a usable attempt into an approved application.</p><div class="note"><strong>Recovery override:</strong> missing photos or vendor-side agreement checks may be overridden by you. The system will still block banned vendors, duplicate bookings, closed booth areas, sold-out markets, and physically full booth inventory.</div><div class="grid2"><label>Status<select id="recovery-filter"><option value="active">Needs review</option><option value="failed">Failed</option><option value="abandoned">Abandoned</option><option value="overridden">Recovered</option><option value="dismissed">Dismissed</option><option value="all">All attempts</option></select></label><label>Search<input id="recovery-search" type="search" placeholder="Name, business, email, phone or error"></label></div><p id="recovery-summary" class="muted"></p><div id="recovery-list" class="list"></div></section>';
